# data/serving/*.csv is tracked deliberately: the scheduled
# .github/workflows/refresh-bou-data.yml workflow commits it here as the
# published, consumer-facing output (e.g. oakstone-allocation-os's
# packages/connectors/impala_bou.py reads it). Everything upstream of it
# (raw downloads, normalized/curated partitions, per-run logs) stays
# untracked and run-local.
